 "id": "01a1080d-241c-7841-97ee-bb910db2004a",
 "content": "Verify every payment-provider (PSP) webhook before calling get_json(): compute HMAC-SHA256 over the raw request body with the secret in the `PSP_WEBHOOK_SECRET` env var, compare it with hmac.compare_digest against the `Psp-Signature` header, and reject events whose `Psp-Signature-Timestamp` header is more than 120 seconds old (replay protection). Answer a failed check with 401 via errors.problem. (PSP webhook spec v2, Oct 2026: timestamp header renamed from `Psp-Timestamp`, window cut from 300s to 120s.)",
 "premise": "while the PSP's webhook spec is v2"
}
